#: includes/Core/INFYP_Redirect_Health.php:526
msgid ""
"A test of an old image URL was answered by your web server before WordPress "
"could send the 301 redirect. Renamed images keep working inside your "
"content, but external links and search engines that still use an old image "
"URL get an error instead of the new image."
