msgid "Avoid AI-generated generic descriptions"
msgstr "Elakkan penerangan generik yang dihasilkan oleh AI"

#: includes/views/seo-score-page.php:499
msgid "2024-2025 Updates:"
msgstr "Kemas Kini 2024-2025:"

#: includes/views/seo-score-page.php:499
msgid ""
"Google emphasizes a \"people-first\" approach - describe images naturally "
"for users while incorporating relevant keywords. The algorithm rewards "
"useful, information-rich content over keyword-stuffed metadata."
msgstr ""
"Google menekankan pendekatan \"people-first\" - terangkan imej secara semula"
" jadi untuk pengguna sambil memasukkan kata kunci yang relevan. Algoritma "
"memberi ganjaran kepada kandungan yang berguna dan kaya maklumat berbanding "
"metadata yang dipenuhi kata kunci."

