msgstr "Google Search Central - Amalan Terbaik SEO Imej"

#: includes/views/seo-score-page.php:524
msgid ""
"Updated July 11, 2025 - Official guidance on descriptive filenames, alt text"
" as the most important attribute, and avoiding keyword stuffing. Emphasizes "
"describing images for users with a \"people-first\" approach."
msgstr ""
