#: includes/views/seo-score-page.php:540
msgid ""
"Sep 23, 2024 - John Mueller confirms alt text remains crucial even with AI "
"vision. Context-specific alt text helps Google understand why an image is "
"used on a page."
msgstr ""
"23 Sep, 2024 - John Mueller mengesahkan teks alt kekal penting walaupun "
"dengan penglihatan AI. Teks alt khusus konteks membantu Google memahami "
"mengapa imej digunakan pada halaman."

