msgstr "Ahrefs - Senarai Semak SEO Pada Halaman Komprehensif 2024"

#: includes/views/seo-score-page.php:552
msgid ""
"Mar 28, 2024 - Emphasizes short, descriptive, relevant filenames and alt "
"text. Aligns with Google's guidance on using appropriate keywords naturally."
msgstr ""
"28 Mac, 2024 - Menekankan nama fail dan teks alt yang pendek, deskriptif, "
